    },
    {
      "id": "notification-approved",
      "type": "node",
      "position": { "x": 2240, "y": 80 },
      "data": {
        "type": "notification",
        "icon": "PaperPlaneRight",
        "properties": {
          "label": "Notify Customer - Approved",
          "description": "BPMN serviceTask 'notifyApprovedTask' (camunda:delegateExpression=\"${notifyCustomerDelegate}\", field outcome=APPROVED). This node is terminal (no outgoing edges) - Workflow Builder has no explicit End-event node type, so BPMN endEvent 'endApproved' has no separate node here.",
          "type": "email",
          "status": "active",
          "sendEmail": {
            "address": "{{applicant.email}}",
            "copy": "",
            "subject": "Your KYC verification has been approved",
            "body": "Hello {{applicant.name}}, your KYC case has been approved.",
            "priority": "normal",
            "retries": 3,
            "retryOnFailure": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notification-rejected",
      "type": "node",
      "position": { "x": 2240, "y": 460 },
      "data": {
        "type": "notification",
        "icon": "PaperPlaneRight",
        "properties": {
          "label": "Notify Customer - Rejected",
          "description": "BPMN serviceTask 'notifyRejectedTask' (camunda:delegateExpression=\"${notifyCustomerDelegate}\", field outcome=REJECTED). Three BPMN incoming flows converge here (still-missing documents, EDD not cleared, compliance rejection), matching this node's three incoming edges below. Terminal (no outgoing edges) - BPMN endEvent 'endRejected' has no separate node, same reasoning as the approved path.",
          "type": "email",
          "status": "active",
          "sendEmail": {
            "address": "{{applicant.email}}",
            "copy": "",
            "subject": "Your KYC verification was not approved",
            "body": "Hello {{applicant.name}}, your KYC case has been rejected.",
            "priority": "normal",
            "retries": 3,
            "retryOnFailure": true
          }
        }
      }
    }
